---
import Container from './Container.astro';
import { PRINCIPLES } from '../../data/content';
---

<section
  id="manifesto"
  aria-labelledby="manifesto-heading"
  class="relative scroll-mt-24 py-28 lg:py-44"
>
  <Container>
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-fg-muted">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-sakura-gradient"></span>
        Manifesto
      </p>

      <h2
        id="manifesto-heading"
        class="i-text text-balance font-sans text-display-lg font-semibold"
      >
        The web should be
        <em class="accent-serif text-sakura-gradient inline-block pb-[0.1em] -mr-[0.02em] pr-[0.02em] text-[1.12em] leading-[0.9]">
          felt
        </em>
        , not merely seen.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="space-y-8 lg:col-span-7" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <p class="i-text i-text-muted text-pretty text-xl leading-relaxed sm:text-2xl">
          Most websites are built to be looked at. We build ours to be remembered. Between the first
          paint and the final scroll there is a quiet stretch of attention, and we treat it as
          something precious.
        </p>
        <p class="i-text i-text-muted text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed sm:text-xl">
          Our studio sits where design, engineering and performance overlap. We write every line
          ourselves, choose every curve deliberately, and hold each project to a simple standard: it
          should load instantly, rank honestly, and leave a small impression that lingers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 220ms">
        <div class="glass rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10">
          <p lang="ja" class="text-6xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-sakura-a sm:text-7xl">
            木漏れ日
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-fg-muted">
            <span class="accent-serif text-xl normal-case tracking-normal text-fg">Komorebi</span>
            &nbsp;/ ko·mo·re·bi
          </p>
          <p class="i-text i-text-muted mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            The interplay of light and leaves: sunlight filtering through trees, shifting with every
            breath of wind. A word with no direct translation, and the feeling we design for.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-20 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3 lg:mt-28">
      {PRINCIPLES.map((p, i) => (
        <li data-reveal style={`--reveal-delay: ${i * 120}ms`}>
          <div class="glass h-full rounded-3xl p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-sakura-a">0{i + 1}</p>
            <h3 class="i-text accent-serif mt-5 text-4xl">{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="i-text i-text-muted mt-4 leading-relaxed">{p.text}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </Container>
</section>
